
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>HAANS VGRAPHER</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #090909;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    header {
      padding: 24px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    nav a { font-size: 11px; color: #aaa; }
    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      padding: 100px 8%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 35%, #303030, #090909 65%);
    }
    .label { color: #999; letter-spacing: 4px; font-size: 11px; }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 100px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -4px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    h1 span { color: #777; }
    .intro { max-width: 460px; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      border: 1px solid #aaa;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      width: fit-content;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    section { padding: 70px 8%; border-top: 1px solid #292929; }
    h2 { font-size: 34px; }
    .works {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .work { background: #161616; }
    .visual {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #383838, #111, #292929);
      color: #bbb;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .work h3, .work p { margin-left: 15px; margin-right: 15px; }
    .work p, .about { color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; }
    footer {
      padding: 25px 8%;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 550px) {
      header { flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
      nav { gap: 16px; }
      .hero { min-height: 65vh; padding: 70px 7%; }
      h1 { letter-spacing: -2px; }
      .works { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      section { padding: 50px 7%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a class="logo" href="#home">HAANS VGRAPHER.</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#works">WORKS</a>
      <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
      <a href="#contact">CONTACT</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero" id="home">
      <p class="label">VIDEOGRAPHY · VISUAL STORYTELLING</p>
      <h1>EVERY FRAME<br><span>TELLS A STORY.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Mengabadikan momen, merangkai cerita, dan
        menciptakan visual yang bermakna.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="#works">EXPLORE MY WORK ↗</a>
    </div>

    <section id="works">
      <p class="label">MY PORTFOLIO</p>
      <h2>Selected Works.</h2>
      <div class="works">
        <article class="work">
          <div class="visual">01 / EVENT FILM</div>
          <h3>Event & After Movie</h3>
          <p>Momen yang diabadikan menjadi cerita.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="work">
          <div class="visual">02 / CINEMATIC</div>
          <h3>Cinematic Visuals</h3>
          <p>Menemukan cerita dalam setiap frame.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="work">
          <div class="visual">03 / DOCUMENTARY</div>
          <h3>Documentary</h3>
          <p>Cerita nyata dari sudut pandang visual.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="work">
          <div class="visual">04 / CREATIVE</div>
          <h3>Creative Projects</h3>
          <p>Ide kreatif yang diwujudkan menjadi visual.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <p class="label">BEHIND THE CAMERA</p>
      <h2>Hello, I'm Haans.</h2>
      <p class="about">
        Seorang kreator visual yang tertarik pada videografi,
        video editing, dan digital storytelling. Bagiku, video
        bukan hanya tentang gambar yang indah, tetapi juga
        cerita di balik setiap momen.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <p class="label">LET'S CONNECT</p>
      <h2>Have a story to tell?</h2>
      <p class="about">Mari ciptakan sesuatu yang bermakna.</p>
      <a class="button"
         href="https://www.instagram.com/hans_vgrapher/"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        INSTAGRAM ↗
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>© 2026 HAANS VGRAPHER · MADE WITH PASSION.</footer>
</body>
</html>
